{"2527570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gunship Global Operations", "steam_appid": 2527570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the gunner’s seat of the AC-130, the guardian angel of the battlefield. In this tactical shooter, you will conduct reconnaissance, deliver devastating fire support, and protect allied forces during dangerous missions across diverse conflict zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527570/extras/c2080c52830f4441d090d0cfd513e065.poster.avif?t=1770110881\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527570/extras/c2080c52830f4441d090d0cfd513e065.webm?t=1770110881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527570/extras/c2080c52830f4441d090d0cfd513e065.mp4?t=1770110881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br><strong>Precision Fire Support:</strong> Use 25mm, 40mm, and 105mm cannons to neutralize threats with pinpoint accuracy.<br><strong>Immersive Combat Atmosphere:</strong> Experience the tension of the battlefield with authentic night vision, thermal imaging, and radio chatter.<br><strong>Strategic Gameplay:</strong> Identify targets, prioritize threats, and adapt instantly to changing mission parameters.<br><strong>Dynamic Missions:</strong> From convoy protection to high-value target elimination, each operation offers unique tactical challenges.<br><strong>Rich Narrative Backdrop:</strong> Confront the enigmatic mastermind known as Zmey, whose shadow looms over a global conflict.</p></li></ul><p c